{"title":"Career roadmap · Community Manager","role":"Community Manager","summary":"A Community Manager builds, manages and grows communities around a brand, product, platform or organisation. The role combines social media, content, customer engagement, events, analytics, partnerships and brand communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Digital Business / E-Commerce / Social Media"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA focused on Digital Business / E-Commerce / Social Media, this is a strong direct alignment."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Business/E-Commerce/Social Media","Social Media/Community Intern","Community Executive","Community Manager","Senior Community Manager","Community Lead","Head of Community / Community & Social Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build social media, content, community engagement, analytics and digital-business skills. Graduate with 2–3 internships and a strong community portfolio."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in brand, product, creator, gaming, developer, e-commerce or customer communities."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Community Lead, Community Marketing Manager, Social Media Manager or Customer Advocacy Manager."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead large communities and combine community strategy, brand, creator partnerships, customer experience and AI-driven engagement."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Digital-business foundation"},{"text":"Marketing, communication, consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Brand/community analysis"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Social-media fundamentals"},{"text":"Content strategy, platforms, engagement"},{"text":"Manage a small community/page"},{"text":"Communication"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Content + community strategy"},{"text":"Content calendars, storytelling, moderation"},{"text":"30–60 day content plan"},{"text":"Content capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Community analytics"},{"text":"KPIs, dashboards, audience insights"},{"text":"Community analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Community campaigns"},{"text":"Campaign planning, events, creator marketing"},{"text":"Community growth campaign"},{"text":"Growth"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Brand/community environment"},{"text":"Internship + campaign case study"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Community leadership"},{"text":"Partnerships, crisis management, advocacy"},{"text":"Lead a community project"},{"text":"Leadership"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Placement readiness"},{"text":"Case studies, portfolio, interviews"},{"text":"Portfolio + applications"},{"text":"Career transition"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to master"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Social Media Marketing"},{"text":"E-Commerce"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Brand Management"},{"text":"Marketing Management"},{"text":"Digital Business"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Public Relations"},{"text":"Customer Relationship Management"},{"text":"Marketing Research"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Content Marketing"},{"text":"E-Commerce Operations"},{"text":"Strategic Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical and professional skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Community management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community strategy"},{"text":"Community guidelines"},{"text":"Moderation"},{"text":"Member onboarding"},{"text":"Engagement campaigns"},{"text":"Community events"},{"text":"User-generated content"},{"text":"Feedback collection"},{"text":"Community health monitoring"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Crisis communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"X"},{"text":"Facebook"},{"text":"Reddit"},{"text":"Discord"},{"text":"WhatsApp Communities"},{"text":"Telegram"},{"text":"Platform-specific content strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Content repurposing"},{"text":"Social creatives"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Basic graphic design"},{"text":"Influencer/creator content"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement rate"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Follower/member growth"},{"text":"Active members"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Referral rate"},{"text":"Community-generated leads"},{"text":"Customer satisfaction"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools to learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Meta Business Suite"},{"text":"Social analytics platforms"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Slack"},{"text":"Discord"},{"text":"CRM platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 6–8 practical projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram community-growth campaign"},{"text":"LinkedIn professional community strategy"},{"text":"Discord/online community launch"},{"text":"E-commerce customer community"},{"text":"Brand ambassador programme"},{"text":"Creator/influencer community campaign"},{"text":"Community event/webinar"},{"